{59}{The last dragon in Arcanum was Bellerogrim...the mightiest, most fearsome creature who walked the land.  And so I went straight to his lair, and battled him to the death in order to get a single drop of blood!  It was a ferocious battle, but in the end, I was victorious.  Even as a mortal man, I was very, very brave and powerful...}{The last dragon in Arcanum was Bellerogrim...the mightiest, most fearsome creature who walked the land.  And so I went straight to his lair, and battled him to the death in order to get a single drop of blood!  It was a ferocious battle, but in the end, I was victorious.  Even as a mortal man, I was very, very brave and powerful...}{}{}{}{}
